### Get Event Invites (Manager w/o Access)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Post an Invite (Manager w/o Access)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING",
  "userId": 5,
  "message": "Editted Msg",
  "eventId": 1
}

### Put an Invite (Manager w/o Access)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED",
  "userId": 10,
  "message": "Editted Msg",
  "eventId": 1
}

### Delete an Invite (Manager w/o Access)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/users/10/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check caller before assigning managers (must return role ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Manager to Event (caller must be ADMIN; user 10 must be MANAGER)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/1/managers/10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Event Invites (Manager w/ Access)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Post an Invite (Manager w/ Access)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING",
  "userId": 5,
  "message": "Really big Msg",
  "eventId": 2
}

### Put an Invite (Manager w/ Access)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED",
  "userId": 5,
  "message": "Back to normal",
  "eventId": 2
}

### Delete an Invite (Manager assigned to event 2; returns 204 if present)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/users/5/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




